	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  ORDER BY hors du scope de DISTINCT ON]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=13521#p13521"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>J&#039;aurais tendance à utiliser ça :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT distinct (location), time from weather_reports order by time;</code></pre></div><p>Vous pouvez aussi faire (à partir de la 8.4) :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>with req as (select location, time from weather_reports group by location, time)
select location from req order by time;</code></pre></div>]]></content>
